intermediate"><addressbook><name>HOMME, TAKUYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKABAYASHI, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A scintillator panel (1) in which the surfaces of an Al substrate (10) of the panel (1) have been subjected to sand blasting, a MgF2 film (12) as a low refractive index material is formed on one of the surfaces and a scintillator (14) having a cylindrical structure which converts an incident radiation ray to a visible light is formed on the surface of the MgF2 film (12), the scintillator (14) together with the substrate (10) being covered by a polyparaxylene film (16).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un panneau de scintillateur (1) dans lequel les surfaces d'un substrat Al (10) ont été traitées par gravure au sable. Un revêtement de MgF2 (12) utilisé comme matériau à faible indice de réfraction est formé sur une des surfaces du substrat, et un scintillateur (14) à structure cylindrique pouvant convertir un rayonnement incident en lumière visible est formé sur la surface du revêtement de MgF2 (12). Le scintillateur (14) et le substrat (10) sont recouverts ensemble d'un revêtement en polyparaxylène (16).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>